Z||000000||Jefrysuko||10-26-2001||02:24 AM||||It looks like we are beginning to convert BlackStang95.  Here is his quote.<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by BlackStang95:<BR><B>I would love one if I had some extra money lying around.  Anyone got an 84 2m4 they wanna get rid of?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>If you don't believe it just go and check it out <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/011292.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/011292.html</A> <P>I knew he was just putting on a front.  So from now on guys be nice to him because he really wants to be one of us.  You see here is what happened.  His friend got a Fiero and he saw how much better it was than his car but didn't want to admit it because he had been bragging so much about his mustang.  Now if he admits that he wants a Fiero everyone will make fun of him so he has to go along with professing how cool his car is even though he really doesn't think it is anymore.  So he is on this forum now to find out more about Fieros so that he can find some reason to get a Fiero that won't make him look foolish.  Yet he still has to put up that front because his friend is on the forum.  So it looks like his plan now is to get a cheap Fiero and play with it for awhile and wait till his mustang breaks down or something.  I bet that is what he has in mind and then after the mustang is gone he will buy a couple more Fieros and get a tattoo of a prancing horse on his arm.<P>Don't be fooled by him denying all of this though.  It is just the pain of not having a Fiero.  I am sure you all understand.  So just know that from now on when he talks about his mustang just know that is him crying out for help.  And if anyone can help the poor guy get a Fiero please put him out of his misery.<P>||||reg||12
