Z||000002||Formula88||10-26-2001||09:52 AM||||Actually, he's seems to be getting better.  He came in here all full of p!ss and vinegar, with a chip on his shoulder, but I think he's starting to chill a bit.  I have no problem with him being a Mustang fan.  It was his absolutes about how ANY Mustang is faster than ANY Fiero (not exact argument, but you get the idea) that I took exception with.  Personally, I don't understand why a non-Fiero enthusiast would want to hang out here, other than to cause trouble.  But maybe he's realizing that Fieros, while they weren't blazing fast from the factory, have more hop up potential than most cars built in the last 20 years.  <P>||||reg||1
